Type: Shiny
Title: SLC Flight Volume Explorer
Version: 1.0.0
Description: A Shiny application for exploring Salt Lake City International
    Airport flight-volume patterns by calendar date category. The app compares
    daily main-flight and diverted-flight counts with same-year average daily
    volumes, including weekday and holiday categories, using precomputed
    slcflights-derived data. The deployed app reads prepared .rds files and
    does not import slcflights at runtime.
Imports:
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    grid,
    plotly,
    shiny
